OCMAT 1
# Written by the Aver Engine editor.
# NeonDistrict: "Sci-fi stairs with neon backlighting (4 floors)" by tekuto1s (@tekuto1s), CC BY 4.0 -- https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/sci-fi-stairs-with-neon-backlighting-4-floors-ef4652f0d660445783fa9037c75e4ce2
NAME NeonDistrict_sf34_light
SHADER standard
BLEND opaque
CULL none
FLAGS twosided=1 castshadow=1 worlduv=0

PARAM baseColorFactor 1 1 1 1
PARAM metallicFactor 1
PARAM roughnessFactor 1
# Emissive in engine units: 1 = a white wall in full sun, about 33,000 cd/m2. Peak 0.15 = about 5,000 cd/m2:
# blue neon backlight strips along the tread edges and outer stringer (Object_6): flat emissiveFactor (0.0, 0.318, 1.0), no emissive texture, no base colour texture. Luminance of the colour is only 0.30, so at 0.15 it comes out at about 1,500 cd/m2, a normal neon tube.
PARAM emissiveFactor 0 0.04765 0.15
PARAM normalScale 1
PARAM occlusionStrength 1
PARAM reflectance 0.04
PARAM f90 1
PARAM ior 1.5
PARAM transmission 0
PARAM uvTiling 200
